; THE FINAL WALK IS SPLIT so that the exit contract is CHECKED; a contract
; attaches to the NEXT instruction  so one written after the LAST
; instruction in a program can never fire at all; Other programs in this
; tree carry such a claim  which HANDOFF counts  and it reads as enforced
; when it is only prose;
; Splitting the walk by one cell costs no instructions and buys a real
; check on every run;
L988
; ASSERT ptr=1
; j is NOT claimed clear: a message ending partway through a block leaves
; the rest of that keystream counted and unused  which is the whole reason
; the tail needs no special case; Nor is the window  which holds the tenth
; round key  nor the state  which holds what is left of the keystream;
; ASSERT zero 983:989
; ASSERT zero 991:1011
L1

